<title>UK: Uneximbank privately places $50 mln three-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>Uneximbank privately places $50 mln three-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's United Export Import Bank (Uneximbank) has launched a $50 million three-year FRN via its Dutch subsidiary Unexim International Finance BV, lead manager Merrill Lynch said on Monday.</p>
<p>The deal was privately placed, and was the first unsecured borrowing in the international capital markets for a Russian company, Merrill Lynch said.  </p>
<p>Uneximbank was founded in 1993 by a number of Russian export and trading companies. It is the third largest bank in Russia when ranked by assets, Merrill Lynch said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
